<title>UK: UK's JLI says gets approaches.</title>
<headline>UK's JLI says gets approaches.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>British food products supplier JLI Group Plc said on Wednesday it had received preliminary approaches that could lead to an offer being made for the company.</p>
<p>JLI said it would make further announcements &quot;as appropriate&quot;.</p>
<p>The firm's shares shot up more than 38 percent, rising 21.5p to 77.5 by 1350 GMT to lead the list of top percentage gainers on the London Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
